"Email advice allows you to receive a professional assessment from a "
"certified dermatologist via email within two working days. Based on your "
"input or AI assessment, the doctor will provide their evaluation and "
"recommendations in writing. Email advice is limited to written guidance. If "
"your situation requires further treatment steps to be arranged, the doctor "
"will recommend a video or walk-in consultation instead."
