msgid ""
"A video consultation allows you to have a remote appointment with the doctor "
"via a secure video platform, from the comfort of your own home. Because the "
"consultation takes place in real time, the doctor can discuss your skin "
"concern in more detail and arrange any further treatment steps directly "
"during the appointment."
